  {
   "id": "-BZivF8MCgAJ",
   "from": "lv xiao",
   "author": "96a78639336ed702",
   "date": "2019-04-25T04:18:12Z",
   "subject": "Why 3D points selected by digit.fixed do not lie on the surface of the mesh",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I have a sample of 3D mesh here (<a href=\"https://github.com/Patricklv/A-sample-of-3D-facial-images\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/Patricklv/A-sample-of-3D-facial-images&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484982272000&amp;usg=AOvVaw29dKekOMMCj9K9i7t8m3p8\">https://github.com/Patricklv/A-sample-of-3D-facial-images</a>). I use the code below to select 5 points on the mesh surface:</div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">sample </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ply</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;C:\\\\Users\\\\&lt;Username&gt;\\\\demoFace.ply&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><font color=\"#000088\"><span style=\"color:#008\">fixed</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> digit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#008\">fixed</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">fixed</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> center </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></font><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div>Output</div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">fixed</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        xpts     ypts     zpts<br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">61.782795</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">83.92956</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">25.78687</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#066\">22.131445</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">86.52447</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">28.26665</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">19.575115</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">52.92110</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">58.31129</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">37.825545</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">16.08152</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">38.84842</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#000\">   </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2.542866</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">16.97267</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">39.26497</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div>A snapshot of the 5 digitized landmarks:</div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/geomorph-r-package/attach/a0c5fbc6216f8/Snipaste_2019-04-25_12-15-17.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Snipaste_2019-04-25_12-15-17.png\" width=\"287\" height=\"320\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">I used the follow code to double check the position of the 5 landmarks on the surface mesh:</p><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">open3d</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>read</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ply</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;C:\\\\Users\\\\&lt;Username&gt;\\\\demoFace.ply&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>plot3d</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">fixed</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> type </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;s&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> radius </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> col </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;red&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> aspect </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> F</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> add </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><font color=\"#666600\" face=\"monospace\"><br></font>Strangely, none of the 5 points lie on the surface of the mesh:</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/geomorph-r-package/attach/a0c5fbc6216f8/Snipaste_2019-04-25_12-13-49.png?part=0.2&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Snipaste_2019-04-25_12-13-49.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"220\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">Why this issue here, should I have faith in the 5 points I digited?</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br></span></p><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "7TSMcUi4DQAJ",
   "from": "Antigoni Kaliontzopoulou",
