   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thank you. That solved my issue.<div><br></div><div>I tried to install column mean back to the scaled coordinate data and plotted them using plot3d and the 5 points are then on the surface of mesh.</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">fixed_ori </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cbind</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">fixed</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mean</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sample$vb</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,]),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">fixed</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mean</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sample$vb</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,]),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">fixed</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mean</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sample$vb</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,]))</span></div></code></div></div></div>"
    ],
