    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>plot3d</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fixed_ori</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> type </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;s&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> radius </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> col </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;red&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> aspect </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> F</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> add </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div>The plotspec function you mentioned is certainly the easier solution. </div><div><br></div><div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br>On Thursday, 25 April 2019 17:16:30 UTC+8, Antigoni Kaliontzopoulou  wrote:</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div text=\"#000000\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\">\r\n    <p>This is because you are trying to plot &quot;by hand&quot; using plot3d on\r\n      the raw imported mesh, and digit.fixed centers the mesh (argument\r\n      center = T, recommended). <br>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p>Try plotspec geomorph function instead, should work fine.</p>\r\n    <p>Antigoni<br>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <div>On 25/04/2019 05:18, lv xiao wrote:<br>\r\n    </div>\r\n    </div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div text=\"#000000\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\"><blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n      \r\n      <div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n        <div>I have a sample of 3D mesh here\r\n          (<a href=\"https://github.com/Patricklv/A-sample-of-3D-facial-images\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/Patricklv/A-sample-of-3D-facial-images&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484982289000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1jmSR74G1jiuFg-jizA3T-\">https://github.com/Patricklv/A-sample-of-3D-facial-images</a>). I\r\n          use the code below to select 5 points on the mesh surface:</div>\r\n        <div><br>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code>\r\n            <div><span style=\"color:#000\">sample </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> read</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ply</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;C:\\\\Users\\\\&lt;Username&gt;\\\\demoFace.ply&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>\r\n                <br>\r\n              </span><font color=\"#000088\"><span style=\"color:#008\">fixed</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> digit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#008\">fixed</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">fixed</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">\r\n                  center </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></font><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>\r\n              </span></div>\r\n          </code></div>\r\n        <div><br>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div>Output</div>\r\n        <div>\r\n          <div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code>\r\n              <div><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">fixed</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>\r\n                          xpts     ypts     zpts<br>\r\n                </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">61.782795</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">83.92956</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">25.78687</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>\r\n                </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#066\">22.131445</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">86.52447</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">28.26665</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>\r\n                </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">19.575115</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">52.92110</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">58.31129</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>\r\n                </span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">37.825545</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">16.08152</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">38.84842</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>\r\n                </span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#000\">   </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2.542866</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">16.97267</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">39.26497</span></div>\r\n            </code></div>\r\n          <div><br>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div><br>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div>A snapshot of the 5 digitized landmarks:</div>\r\n        <p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><img alt=\"Snipaste_2019-04-25_12-15-17.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" width=\"287\" height=\"320\"></p>\r\n        <p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br>\r\n        </p>\r\n        <p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br>\r\n        </p>\r\n        <p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">I\r\n          used the follow code to double check the position of the 5\r\n          landmarks on the surface mesh:</p>\r\n        <div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code>\r\n            <div><span style=\"color:#000\">open3d</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>\r\n                <br>\r\n                read</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ply</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;C:\\\\Users\\\\&lt;Username&gt;\\\\demoFace.ply&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>\r\n                <br>\r\n                plot3d</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">fixed</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> type </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;s&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> radius\r\n              </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> col </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;red&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> aspect\r\n              </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> F</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> add </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div>\r\n          </code></div>\r\n        <p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><font face=\"monospace\" color=\"#666600\"><br>\r\n            </font>Strangely, none of the 5 points lie on the surface of\r\n            the mesh:</span></p>\r\n        <p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><img alt=\"Snipaste_2019-04-25_12-13-49.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" width=\"320\" height=\"220\"></p>\r\n        <p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br>\r\n        </p>\r\n        <p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br>\r\n        </p>\r\n        <p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">Why\r\n          this issue here, should I have faith in the 5 points I\r\n          digited?</p>\r\n        <p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><br>\r\n          </span></p>\r\n        <div><br>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      -- <br>\r\n      You received this message because you are subscribed to the Google\r\n      Groups &quot;geomorph R package&quot; group.<br></blockquote></div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ],
